  <Title type="string">Notes on silence, in three coats of varnish</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Rangi Ulloa talks about a square that refuses to be a square. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
